#### Get all shops
GET {{url_dev}}/shop/all?page=1&limit=20&sort=-createdAt
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}


#### Search shops by name
GET {{url_dev}}/shop/search?keyword=test
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}


#### Get shop by ID
GET {{url_dev}}/shop/id/{{shopId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

#### Get shop by slug
GET {{url_dev}}/shop/slug/test-shop
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

#### Get my shop (Protected)
GET {{url_dev}}/shop/my-shop
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
authorization: {{accessToken}}

#### Create shop (multipart/form-data) - With images
POST {{url_dev}}/shop/create-shop
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
authorization: {{accessToken}}

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Cửa hàng điện thoại ABC
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Chuyên cung cấp điện thoại chính hãng
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address[street]"

123 Nguyễn Huệ
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address[wardCode]"

26734
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address[wardName]"

Phường Bến Nghé
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address[districtCode]"

760
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address[districtName]"

Quận 1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address[provinceCode]"

79
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address[provinceName]"

Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../test-files/avatar.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="banner"; filename="banner.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../test-files/banner.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

#### Create shop without images (JSON)
POST {{url_dev}}/shop/create-shop
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
authorization: {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "My Test Shop",
  "description": "This is a test shop description",
  "address": {
    "street": "123 Test Street",
    "wardCode": "00101",
    "wardName": "Phường Bến Nghé",
    "districtCode": "760",
    "districtName": "Quận 1",
    "provinceCode": "79",
    "provinceName": "Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh"
  }
}

