#### Update shop without images (Protected - JSON)
PATCH {{url_dev}}/shop/id/{{shopId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
authorization: {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Updated Shop Name",
  "description": "Updated shop description",
  "address": {
    "street": "456 Updated Street",
    "wardCode": "00102",
    "wardName": "Phường Đa Kao",
    "districtCode": "760",
    "districtName": "Quận 1",
    "provinceCode": "79",
    "provinceName": "Thành phố Hồ Chí Minh"
  }
}

#### Update shop - only name (Protected - JSON)
PATCH {{url_dev}}/shop/id/{{shopId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
authorization: {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Only Name Updated"
}

#### Delete shop (Protected)
DELETE {{url_dev}}/shop/id/{{shopId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
authorization: {{accessToken}}
